    {
      "name": "help",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/api/"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "type": "text/markdown",
        "body": "# realm — owner access\n\nrealm is a personal dump of notes and files, kept in realms. \nBase URL: https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>\nNo login needed beyond this URL plus the bearer token. All responses are JSON unless noted.\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/info\"   # what this access allows, without spending a use\n\n## Realms\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms\"   → {\"realms\": [{id, name, created, count, updated}]}\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X POST \"https://realm.test/api/realms\" -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{\"name\":\"Trip\"}'\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X PATCH \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>\" -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{\"name\":\"Holiday\"}'\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X DELETE \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>\"   # deletes everything in it\nThe routes below work per realm.\n\n## Find things\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items?limit=20\"                   # newest first\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items?q=invoice+march\"            # full-text search over text and file names\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items?kind=image,file&limit=50\"   # filter by kind\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items?before=<id>\"                # next page (response has \"next\")\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items?since=<n>\"                  # what was added after a list's \"since\"\n→ {\"items\": [Item...], \"next\": \"<id>\"|null}\nItem: {id, kind: note|link|image|audio|video|file, text, name, mime, size, realm, src, created(epoch ms)}\n\n## Fetch an item\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items/<id>\"                       # metadata\ncurl -sLo out.bin -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items/<id>/raw\"         # file bytes (or note text). Supports Range.\n\n## Add things\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X POST \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items\" --data-binary \"some text\"          # a note\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -T ./report.pdf \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/files/report.pdf\"                 # a file (≤ 95 MB), ?text=caption optional\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -F file=@a.png -F file=@b.png -F text=caption \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items\"  # form upload\n\nBigger files: multipart, parts of equal size (e.g. 32 MiB, last may be smaller):\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X POST \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/uploads\" -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{\"name\":\"big.mkv\"}'   → {\"upload\": U}\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -T part1 \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/uploads/U/1\"     → {\"part\":1,\"etag\":E1}   (repeat for 2..N)\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X POST \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/uploads/U/complete\" -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{\"parts\":[{\"part\":1,\"etag\":\"E1\"}]}'\n\n## Edit / remove\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X PATCH \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items/<id>\" -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{\"text\":\"new text\"}'\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X DELETE \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/items/<id>\"\n\n## Share links\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X POST \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/links\" -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{\"scope\":\"drop\",\"ttl\":86400,\"label\":\"bob\"}'\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X POST \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/links\" -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{\"items\":[\"<id>\",\"<id>\"],\"uses\":3}'   # just these items\nscope: drop | read | full · items: ids to share only those (read only; one item downloads at the link itself)\nttl seconds (omit = forever) · uses (omit = unlimited) · max_bytes upload budget\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/links\"  ·  curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X DELETE \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/links/<token>\"\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $REALM_TOKEN\" -X PATCH \"https://realm.test/api/realms/<realm>/links/<token>\" -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{\"items\":[\"<id>\"]}'   # change what it shares\n"
      }
    },
